                                        "entry_id": "171df3c6-1ba4-399c-bbac-23cf49482c6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traditional Armenian dish: a kind of porridge made of previously stewed and boned chicken and coarsely ground soaked wheat."
                                        ],
